40" end="03:01.696">that's </span><span begin="03:01.696" end="03:01.960">how </span><span begin="03:01.960" end="03:02.464">I'll </span><span begin="03:02.464" end="03:03.488">remember </span><span begin="03:03.488" end="03:04.048">me </span><span begin="03:04.048" end="03:04.376">and </span><span begin="03:04.376" end="03:05.045">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:05.393" end="03:06.809"><span begin="03:05.393" end="03:05.721">Remember </span><span begin="03:05.721" end="03:06.809">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:07.385" end="03:10.713"><span begin="03:07.385" end="03:07.665">That's </span><span begin="03:07.665" end="03:08.017">how </span><span begin="03:08.017" end="03:08.553">I'll </span><span begin="03:08.553" end="03:09.521">remember </span><span begin="03:09.521" end="03:09.961">me </span><span begin="03:09.961" end="03:10.353">and </span><span begin="03:10.353" end="03:10.713">you</span></p></div></body></tt>